## 一、先把你的“酉性—两个读出—守恒”落实成实际算子

沿用上一轮的定义：

$$
a_\rho=\rho-\frac12,\qquad
b_\rho=\frac1{\rho(1-\rho)},
$$

$$
S=\sum_\rho b_\rho
=2+\gamma_E-\log(4\pi)>0,
$$

$$
F(z)=\sum_\rho\frac{b_\rho}{z-a_\rho},
\qquad
C(z)=\frac{S-F(z)}{S+F(z)}.

$$

